      "result": "Implemented the persistent URL shortener API with Rails 8.0.2 and PostgreSQL. It supports link creation, lookup and listing, click-counted redirects, and JSON validation/error responses. `start.sh` applies pending migrations and serves on `0.0.0.0:8000`; the README explains how to run it.\n\nVerification passed: API smoke checks covered valid and invalid inputs, duplicate codes, unknown links, listing, and redirects incrementing clicks exactly once. I also restarted the server and confirmed a saved link remained available.",
